    {
      "name": "reset_password",
      "description": "Side effects: write. Required inputs: user_id and account_version. Result: user ID, temporary password, and credential version. Sensitive data: temporary_password must be encrypted at rest and never logged. Approval: Policy is required; only an active self-owned account is allowed.",
